DESCRIPTION:Jim Moran College’s Mentor Night takes place on the last Wednesday of each month from 6–8 PM at the Jim Moran Building (111 South Monroe St\, Downtown Tallahassee).\n\nThis event is open to all FSU students and all community members.\n\nThe goal of this event is to foster meaningful mentoring relationships between FSU student entrepreneurs\, community entrepreneurs\, and experienced business leaders. Each session includes networking and the opportunity for attendees to briefly share background information about their ventures and identify their top three business challenges to the group. Mentors then offer feedback\, guidance\, and actionable advice to help the entrepreneur grow and succeed.\n\nJoin us to connect\, collaborate\, and strengthen Tallahassee’s entrepreneurial ecosystem!\n\nQuestions? Contact Wil Joiner at [contact removed]
GEO:30.441408;-84.280283
LOCATION:Jim Moran Building (JMB)\, Event Space
SUMMARY:October Mentor Night 🍕
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/-october-mentor-night26
CATEGORIES:Networking
