DESCRIPTION:AI Tools for Entrepreneurs Workshop\n\nMonday\, November 9th | 5-6:30pm\nLocation: InNOLEvation® Center (Room 226\, Shaw Building\, 644 W. Call St.)\nFeaturing: Bill Lickson\n\nAI is an ever-changing landscape. Join us for a discussion and insight on what tools you have at your disposal through FSU and beyond.\n\n🎤 Free and protected AI databases within the University\n💥 How to use AI tools effectively to save yourself time\n🚀 External options - what’s worth your time and money\n\nNo AI experience required—students from any major are welcome--just bring your questions and entrepreneurial mindset!\n\nQuestions? Contact Holly Galotti at [contact removed].
GEO:30.443814;-84.293584
LOCATION:Roderick K. Shaw Building (RSB)\, InNOLEvation® Center for Student Engagement (RSB 226)
SUMMARY:AI Tools for Entrepreneurs 🍕
