DESCRIPTION:🎓JMC Alumni Panel & Reception\n\nThursday\, Nov 19 | 5:00–7:00 PM | JMB Event Space\n\nThey Sat Where You Sit\, Now They're Killing It!\n\nEver wonder where a Jim Moran College degree can take you? Hear it straight from the source. Join a panel of JMC alumni as they share the real stories behind their careers—how they got there\, what they wish they knew\, and the advice they’d give their college selves.\n\n🎓 Real talk from recent grads\n💡 Career paths you didn’t know were possible\n💬 Honest advice\, lessons\, and inspiration\n🍪 Light drinks and apps will also be provided. \n\nCome curious. Leave motivated.\n\nQuestions? Contact Kirsten Harrison at [contact removed]\n\nIn honor of FSU's Homecoming Week\, we’re hosting "JMC Alumni Week\," where you can catch up with old friends\, make new connections\, and enjoy a relaxed evening with other alumni.\n\nAlumni Week Events\n\nNovember 17th\, 11:00am - 2:00pm Student Expo\n\nNovember 18th\, 6:00pm - 8:00pm Mentor Night
